.TH GRUNDSTRUKHTML 1 "July 2026" "reta_arch_mojo" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
grundStrukHtml \- public frontend for Reta structural HTML generation
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B grundStrukHtml
.RI [ ARGUMENT ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B grundStrukHtml
starts the installed structural HTML frontend for Reta. It delegates to the native core starter when the shared core library build is present.

.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success and non-zero on errors, failed checks, missing build targets, or invalid arguments.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR reta(1), rp(1), rpl(1), rpe(1), rpb(1)
